{
  "Package": "SpatialExperiment",
  "Version": "1.21.0",
  "Title": "S4 Class for Spatially Resolved -omics Data",
  "Description": "Defines an S4 class for storing data from spatial -omics\nexperiments. The class extends SingleCellExperiment to support\nstorage and retrieval of additional information from spot-based\nand molecule-based platforms, including spatial coordinates,\nimages, and image metadata. A specialized constructor function\nis included for data from the 10x Genomics Visium platform.",
